# Safety

- Keep secrets, keys, tokens, and customer data out of code, logs, prompts, and pull request text.
- Skip live payments.
- Skip tags, publishes, deploys, and cloud runs.
- Leave `.github/workflows/publish.yml` undispatched. Its upload jobs stay disabled.
